{"id":4480,"date":"2025-06-28T04:09:48","date_gmt":"2025-06-28T04:09:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4480"},"modified":"2025-08-11T04:01:47","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T04:01:47","slug":"cach-ban-hang-tren-shopee-hieu-qua","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/cach-ban-hang-tren-shopee-hieu-qua\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1ed1n n\u0103m 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"YAihdir45oQDNfx2wepl7wIegud\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WSRfd0IMIo4sm2xgdpDlpG3Vgof\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u1ea1n ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1ed1n nh\u1edd m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh dropshipping \u2013 t\u1ee9c \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e1n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m t\u1eeb nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p, nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01a1n r\u1ed3i chuy\u1ec3n ti\u1ebfp, h\u1ecd s\u1ebd lo kh\u00e2u \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i v\u00e0 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n. C\u00e1ch n\u00e0y gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf r\u1ee7i ro t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh, t\u1ef1 do ch\u1ecdn ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng (ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n, gia d\u1ee5ng&#8230;) v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. \u0110\u1ecdc ngay b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft c\u1ee7a <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong><\/a> \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean Shopee m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1ed1n!<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-VRkBdGtjdoQZGSxXHjBlJNlhgTb\" style=\"text-align: left;\">L\u00e0m th\u1ebf n\u00e0o \u0111\u1ec3 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1ed1n?<\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4488\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4488\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4488\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/49-1.png\" alt=\"L\u00e0m th\u1ebf n\u00e0o \u0111\u1ec3 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1ed1n?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/49-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/49-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/49-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/49-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/49-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4488\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">L\u00e0m th\u1ebf n\u00e0o \u0111\u1ec3 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1ed1n?<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FDhNd2g5Ao3OIpxELValjtBNggf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1ed1n ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n kh\u1ea3 thi n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c dropshipping \u2013 t\u1ee9c l\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n nh\u1eadp kho tr\u01b0\u1edbc. D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ReCXdrOn6oyOFAxDh5flHhJDg8d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>1. T\u00ecm ngu\u1ed3n h\u00e0ng dropship uy t\u00edn<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YOZZdhYweoJq0axXMDFl2itdgBx\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n l\u1ea5y s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 th\u00f4ng tin \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e1n m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i nh\u1eadp h\u00e0ng. Khi c\u00f3 \u0111\u01a1n, h\u1ecd s\u1ebd thay b\u1ea1n giao h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ebfn tay kh\u00e1ch.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KWx0dN2F7ouBTSxhbpblriY7gmd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>2. T\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Shopee v\u00e0 m\u1edf gian h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kp8sdTvlcocuBHxPJEHluu3Egx3\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n tr\u00ean Shopee v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp gian h\u00e0ng: \u0111i\u1ec1n t\u00ean shop, m\u00f4 t\u1ea3, logo, ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n,\u2026<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WaeqdB25UodFstxcN82l4qWDgOb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>3. \u0110\u0103ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u00ean Shopee<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LzyVdZMc0ozuX7xhYPKlVVO8gkf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 t\u1eeb nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p (c\u00f3 ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u SEO) \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng l\u00ean Shopee. \u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, trung th\u1ef1c \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh khi\u1ebfu n\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SSKhd9ajsoqPT2xOfx5lG9DngJf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>4. T\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a gian h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KlQhdJ9Yxo2gEgxYrTolEhYzgMe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vi\u1ebft m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 chi ti\u1ebft, ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1 ch\u1ee9a t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a, g\u1eafn hashtag v\u00e0 \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 \u0111\u1ec3 thu h\u00fat ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IUptdOMsLoIJ4txu6jQlCvZEgnc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>5. X\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DPxJdLVofoI86CxUgEnlZuwuglb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi c\u00f3 \u0111\u01a1n, b\u1ea1n g\u1eedi th\u00f4ng tin \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p. H\u1ecd s\u1ebd \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i v\u00e0 giao h\u00e0ng thay b\u1ea1n. B\u1ea1n v\u1eabn ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m theo d\u00f5i \u0111\u01a1n v\u00e0 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LYhDdcjfXoxGz2xp7VWlAosKgJh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>6. Ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng &amp; nh\u1eadn \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UaoEdnEIZoe0lKxBebNlfjK5gIg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i nhanh, x\u1eed l\u00fd th\u1eafc m\u1eafc \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 t\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 t\u1ed1t \u2013 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 quan tr\u1ecdng khi b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1ed1n. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh \u00edt r\u1ee7i ro, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi kh\u1edfi nghi\u1ec7p, h\u1ecdc sinh \u2013 sinh vi\u00ean ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi mu\u1ed1n th\u1eed s\u1ee9c kinh doanh online tr\u00ean Shopee m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u v\u1ed1n ban \u0111\u1ea7u.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9MWdyQA8oAUxUx4MeylQuUpgEg\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-B3lkdP4eVod97Lxe8gyllkVLgNb\" style=\"text-align: left;\">M\u1eb9o thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp v\u00e0 \u0111\u0103ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u00ean gian h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PL2wdlI77oqZ3YxLrh3lq3Cpgjd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 tr\u00ean Shopee, b\u1ea1n n\u00ean thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp m\u1ed9t gian h\u00e0ng chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u1edbi t\u00ean shop d\u1ec5 nh\u1edb, li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u1ea1n kinh doanh. H\u00e3y s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng logo r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, \u1ea3nh b\u00eca \u0111\u1ed3ng b\u1ed9 phong c\u00e1ch v\u00e0 vi\u1ebft m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 shop ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn, c\u00f3 \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n nh\u01b0 cam k\u1ebft ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ho\u1eb7c ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3. Khi \u0111\u0103ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1 c\u1ea7n r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, ch\u1ee9a t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a ch\u00ednh \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n trong t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm. H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m n\u00ean \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0, ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao, ch\u1ee5p nhi\u1ec1u g\u00f3c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u00e1ch d\u1ec5 h\u00ecnh dung. M\u00f4 t\u1ea3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m tr\u00ecnh b\u00e0y chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng s\u1ed1, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, c\u00f4ng d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean d\u1ec5 \u0111\u1ecdc v\u00e0 s\u00fac t\u00edch. \u0110\u1eebng qu\u00ean ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00fang ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng, g\u1eafn hashtag ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 gia t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 ph\u1ee7.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GkQ8dww6souOfZxYmOPlzz5ggrf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ngo\u00e0i ra, b\u1ea1n n\u00ean kh\u1ea3o s\u00e1t gi\u00e1 th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi ni\u00eam y\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0a ra m\u1ee9c gi\u00e1 c\u1ea1nh tranh, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i c\u1ee7a Shopee nh\u01b0 m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1, Flash Sale ho\u1eb7c \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng t\u1ec9 l\u1ec7 ch\u1ed1t \u0111\u01a1n. Khi b\u1ea1n ch\u0103m ch\u00fat cho t\u1eebng b\u01b0\u1edbc thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp, gian h\u00e0ng s\u1ebd tr\u1edf n\u00ean chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p h\u01a1n, t\u1ea1o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ni\u1ec1m tin v\u00e0 thu h\u00fat kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng h\u01a1n ngay c\u1ea3 khi b\u1ea1n m\u1edbi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VmGtdB76hotACCxcWeNlDTADgzg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4486\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4486\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4486\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/52.png\" alt=\"M\u1eb9o thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp v\u00e0 \u0111\u0103ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u00ean gian h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/52.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/52-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/52-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/52-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/52-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4486\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">M\u1eb9o thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp v\u00e0 \u0111\u0103ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u00ean gian h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YAihdir45oQDNfx2wepl7wIegud\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Jyebd2VusoNm0exzuR4lQy78gHe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch v\u00e0 chi ph\u00ed b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PczBdcRnZoup8KxGyxllDnDtgEf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi tham gia b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n c\u1ea7n tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 nhi\u1ec1u ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch nh\u1eb1m \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed an to\u00e0n v\u00e0 minh b\u1ea1ch. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n bao g\u1ed3m kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u1ea5m, h\u00e0ng gi\u1ea3, h\u00e0ng vi ph\u1ea1m b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n; \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o th\u00f4ng tin m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng; v\u00e0 ph\u1ea3i giao h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00fang th\u1eddi gian cam k\u1ebft. Ngo\u00e0i ra, Shopee c\u0169ng y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n duy tr\u00ec t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i cao, tr\u00e1nh h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n, ho\u00e0n \u0111\u01a1n kh\u00f4ng ch\u00ednh \u0111\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef uy t\u00edn tr\u00ean s\u00e0n. Nh\u1eefng vi ph\u1ea1m c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3nh c\u00e1o, gi\u1ea3m hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ho\u1eb7c th\u1eadm ch\u00ed kh\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AvK1dZqKJoiXnFxbQF0lY9INgjg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u1ec1 chi ph\u00ed, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n tr\u00ean Shopee s\u1ebd ch\u1ecbu m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n nh\u01b0 ph\u00ed c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh theo ph\u1ea7n tr\u0103m gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng (th\u01b0\u1eddng dao \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb 2% \u0111\u1ebfn 6% t\u00f9y ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng), ph\u00ed thanh to\u00e1n kho\u1ea3ng 2.2%, c\u00f9ng v\u1edbi ph\u00ed d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 n\u1ebfu tham gia c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i nh\u01b0 Freeship Xtra ho\u1eb7c Ho\u00e0n Xu Xtra (trung b\u00ecnh 5\u20136%). B\u00ean c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u00f3, n\u1ebfu s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u00eam c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o nh\u01b0 \u0111\u1ea5u th\u1ea7u t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a, flash sale hay hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb banner, b\u1ea1n c\u0169ng s\u1ebd c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 th\u00eam ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch cho c\u00e1c chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LnhYdumHCoq62CxPRVTlFsIigzf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n n\u00ean ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u00ednh to\u00e1n k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng gi\u00e1 b\u00e1n d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean t\u1ed5ng chi ph\u00ed \u0111\u1ea7u v\u00e0o c\u1ed9ng v\u1edbi c\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed t\u1eeb Shopee. Vi\u1ec7c c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean, t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c g\u00f3i h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u1eeb Shopee, ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t h\u00e0ng t\u1ed3n kho v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng s\u1ebd gi\u00fap gi\u1ea3m r\u1ee7i ro ph\u00e1t sinh chi ph\u00ed ngo\u00e0i \u00fd mu\u1ed1n v\u00e0 g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ASxkdYBxuodmycxOEjHlTBU1gYp\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-RRfRdgWEpoODECxmah4lxewtgaf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">C\u00e1ch b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1ed1n cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LzPxdvLaJoAUkvxxTQhl582jgih\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1ed1n l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u kinh doanh online, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u1edbi c\u00e1c m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh nh\u01b0 dropshipping, ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb li\u00ean k\u1ebft ho\u1eb7c b\u00e1n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m s\u1ed1. V\u1edbi s\u1ef1 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u1eeb n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng Shopee, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng t\u1ea1o gian h\u00e0ng, ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 l\u1edbn. B\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch t\u1ed1i \u01b0u SEO, ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o nh\u1ecf gi\u1ecdt, t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i nh\u01b0 TikTok, Facebook v\u00e0 x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, b\u1ea1n ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng ngu\u1ed3n thu nh\u1eadp \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh. H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n t\u1eebng b\u01b0\u1edbc chinh ph\u1ee5c Shopee hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng lo r\u1ee7i ro t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh!<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-LaTDdNNH1oIz6BxoGbelhWGTgWh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Ch\u1ecdn m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh<\/h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F86FdqmPlovZ00x4rx1lAKQVg0c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dropshipping<\/strong>: B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n t\u00ecm kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, khi c\u00f3 \u0111\u01a1n, nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p s\u1ebd x\u1eed l\u00fd t\u1ed3n kho v\u00e0 giao h\u00e0ng. B\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n nh\u1eadp h\u00e0ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc, ch\u1ec9 tr\u1ea3 ti\u1ec1n sau khi b\u00e1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SKdXdz79WoRWLmx1alxlaQ7igRb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb li\u00ean k\u1ebft (Affiliate Marketing)<\/strong>: Qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n kh\u00e1c tr\u00ean Shopee, nh\u1eadn hoa h\u1ed3ng t\u1eeb m\u1ed7i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng (th\u01b0\u1eddng 5-20% gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L9G5dCPiOo4mcDxazjDl3voog7f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m s\u1ed1<\/strong>: T\u1ea1o v\u00e0 b\u00e1n c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m nh\u01b0 ebook, template thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf, kh\u00f3a h\u1ecdc online. Chi ph\u00ed ban \u0111\u1ea7u th\u1ea5p, ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 th\u1eddi gian s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4489\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4489\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4489\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/LEMON-DIGITAL-2.png\" alt=\"Dropshipping (chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u01a1n cho nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p), ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb li\u00ean k\u1ebft (qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 l\u1ea5y hoa h\u1ed3ng), ho\u1eb7c b\u00e1n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m s\u1ed1 (ebook, template).\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/LEMON-DIGITAL-2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/LEMON-DIGITAL-2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/LEMON-DIGITAL-2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/LEMON-DIGITAL-2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/LEMON-DIGITAL-2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4489\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Dropshipping (chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u01a1n cho nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p), ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb li\u00ean k\u1ebft (qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 l\u1ea5y hoa h\u1ed3ng), ho\u1eb7c b\u00e1n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m s\u1ed1 (ebook, template).<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-G9fgd6QoloTTGcx9M6alsBrUgpe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OoOhdBIGHoT2HkxlVMHlC9PkgAf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd gian h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed. B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Shopee, truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o Trung t\u00e2m Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n (Shopee Seller Center) v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng tin nh\u01b0 t\u00ean shop, \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9, t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng. Sau \u0111\u00f3, b\u1ed5 sung logo v\u00e0 m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o s\u1ef1 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p cho gian h\u00e0ng ngay t\u1eeb b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea7u.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-JSy6djhEgo2T0Kx5zqtlybbYgig\" style=\"text-align: left;\">T\u00ecm ngu\u1ed3n h\u00e0ng<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RN28d1wvAoNRRCxhTz6l85qkgkg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1ed1n, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn m\u1ed9t trong ba m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn: dropshipping, ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb li\u00ean k\u1ebft ho\u1eb7c b\u00e1n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m s\u1ed1. V\u1edbi dropshipping, b\u1ea1n t\u00ecm nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p uy t\u00edn tr\u00ean Shopee, Taobao, 1688 ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c nh\u00f3m Facebook chuy\u00ean dropshipping, \u01b0u ti\u00ean b\u00ean c\u00f3 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 t\u1ed1t v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111a d\u1ea1ng. Sau \u0111\u00f3, li\u00ean h\u1ec7 tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp \u0111\u1ec3 th\u01b0\u01a1ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng gi\u00e1 s\u1ec9 v\u00e0 quy tr\u00ecnh chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u01a1n, v\u00ed d\u1ee5 ch\u1ecdn c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m hot trend nh\u01b0 qu\u1ea7n \u00e1o, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n, \u0111\u1ed3 gia d\u1ee5ng c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 t\u1ed1t v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 ti\u00eau th\u1ee5.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OVUod8I4XoSrq0xN3sqlEnI0gzb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">N\u1ebfu ch\u1ecdn ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb li\u00ean k\u1ebft, b\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd Shopee Affiliate qua \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ho\u1eb7c website ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c, sau \u0111\u00f3 ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 hoa h\u1ed3ng cao v\u00e0 nhu c\u1ea7u l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 \u0111\u1ed3 gia d\u1ee5ng, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m hay th\u1eddi trang \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1. C\u00f2n v\u1edbi s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m s\u1ed1, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ef1 t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung nh\u01b0 ebook, m\u1eabu Canva, h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng ho\u1eb7c mua b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n t\u1eeb c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng nh\u01b0 Gumroad, Etsy \u0111\u1ec3 b\u00e1n l\u1ea1i, mi\u1ec5n l\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhu c\u1ea7u th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng Shopee nh\u01b0 m\u1eabu CV, h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn h\u1ecdc k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng hay n\u1ea5u \u0103n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-LfARdDGTZowL9Xx8wCnloEjRgDe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u0110\u0103ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PEmadfVGmo3IJ2xQYZfll8VUgub\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu h\u00fat v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 b\u00e1n h\u01a1n tr\u00ean Shopee, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u c\u00e1c y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n ngay t\u1eeb b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e0i. Ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m n\u00ean ch\u1ee9a t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a ch\u00ednh nh\u01b0 \u201c\u00e1o thun unisex\u201d, \u201cn\u1ed3i chi\u00ean kh\u00f4ng d\u1ea7u\u201d k\u00e8m theo m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn, h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm. V\u1ec1 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh, h\u00e3y s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u1ea3nh ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao t\u1eeb nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c t\u1ef1 ch\u1ee5p r\u1ed3i ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u00e8n th\u00eam logo shop \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NwUCd7zM1oCz3axUB9klIxw9gtV\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ph\u1ea7n m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ea7n chi ti\u1ebft, t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o l\u1ee3i \u00edch, th\u00f4ng s\u1ed1 nh\u01b0 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, c\u00f9ng ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3 r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi l\u1ed3ng gh\u00e9p t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u SEO. Khi \u0111\u1eb7t gi\u00e1, b\u1ea1n n\u00ean c\u00e2n nh\u1eafc sao cho c\u1ea1nh tranh v\u1edbi th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn \u0111\u1ee7 b\u00f9 chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn kho\u1ea3ng 20\u201350% so v\u1edbi gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c. Cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng, n\u00ean k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn nh\u01b0 Giao H\u00e0ng Nhanh ho\u1eb7c Giao H\u00e0ng Ti\u1ebft Ki\u1ec7m \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 tin c\u1eady v\u00e0 linh ho\u1ea1t cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng khi \u0111\u1eb7t mua.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-JmWKdvy99omEmIxQBETlHVEZgLf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Thu h\u00fat kh\u00e1ch<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RZUudvp3Vo2VnDxJOXflCOkvgMc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 gia t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y doanh s\u1ed1 tr\u00ean Shopee, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p nhi\u1ec1u chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. Tr\u01b0\u1edbc ti\u00ean, h\u00e3y t\u1ed1i \u01b0u SEO b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a th\u00f4ng qua c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 \u201cG\u1ee3i \u00fd t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a\u201d trong K\u00eanh Ng\u01b0\u1eddi B\u00e1n. Thay v\u00ec d\u00f9ng t\u1eeb chung chung nh\u01b0 \u201cm\u00e1y xay\u201d, b\u1ea1n n\u00ean d\u00f9ng c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 h\u01a1n nh\u01b0 \u201cm\u00e1y xay sinh t\u1ed1 mini\u201d \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u00fang v\u1edbi h\u00e0nh vi t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zwe1dmlWloS0qnxYherlZHjzgGg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u00ean c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u00f3, h\u00e3y th\u1eed ch\u1ea1y Shopee Ads v\u1edbi ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch nh\u1ecf t\u1eeb 10.000\u201320.000 \u0111\u1ed3ng\/ng\u00e0y v\u00e0 \u01b0u ti\u00ean ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm (Search Ads) \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n \u1edf top \u0111\u1ea7u k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3. Ngo\u00e0i ra, vi\u1ec7c chia s\u1ebb s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u00ean m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i nh\u01b0 Facebook v\u00e0 TikTok c\u0169ng r\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. Tr\u00ean Facebook, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng v\u00e0o c\u00e1c nh\u00f3m mua b\u00e1n ho\u1eb7c fanpage, c\u00f2n TikTok l\u00e0 n\u01a1i l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ec3 l\u00e0m video ng\u1eafn gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ho\u1eb7c so s\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb, gi\u00fap thu h\u00fat s\u1ef1 ch\u00fa \u00fd v\u00e0 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem th\u00e0nh kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MkrDd3Bpsor0EkxPL4LlKNaugke\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZTLxd0L9HoX2lmxM8bklqrLRgDh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u1ea1o m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 (5-10%) ho\u1eb7c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh \u201cMua 2 t\u1eb7ng 1\u201d.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NAJsdIgKnogr8CxQuwwl2N0Wggf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Tham gia c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n c\u1ee7a Shopee nh\u01b0 11.11, 12.12 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KiFjdg1FXoBvKuxYJNelQj4DgGA\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng uy t\u00edn: Khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 5 sao, tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi tin nh\u1eafn nhanh ch\u00f3ng (d\u01b0\u1edbi 1 gi\u1edd).<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4487\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4487\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4487\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/LEMON-DIGITAL-1.png\" alt=\"(T\u1ed1i \u01b0u SEO, ch\u1ea1y Shopee Ads (10-20k\/ng\u00e0y), chia s\u1ebb l\u00ean Facebook, TikTok, t\u1ea1o khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i.)\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/LEMON-DIGITAL-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/LEMON-DIGITAL-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/LEMON-DIGITAL-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/LEMON-DIGITAL-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/LEMON-DIGITAL-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4487\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">T\u1ed1i \u01b0u SEO, ch\u1ea1y Shopee Ads (10-20k\/ng\u00e0y), chia s\u1ebb l\u00ean Facebook, TikTok, t\u1ea1o khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YAihdir45oQDNfx2wepl7wIegud\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Jxe8dZiaNoinV5xuEgulMKHdgxh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">X\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JOYXdzGCcoWzA4xITN3lcbnjgQd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Dropshipping<\/strong>: Khi c\u00f3 \u0111\u01a1n, \u0111\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng t\u1eeb nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p, \u0111i\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng tin kh\u00e1ch v\u00e0o h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng Shopee. Theo d\u00f5i qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh giao h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt cho kh\u00e1ch.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ANrhdLqiooHWPqx7kzll1YUigRe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb li\u00ean k\u1ebft<\/strong>: Ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n chia s\u1ebb link s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, Shopee t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng ghi nh\u1eadn hoa h\u1ed3ng khi kh\u00e1ch mua qua link.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WYsxdqloHohqX6xJUUml2vYMgEe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m s\u1ed1<\/strong>: G\u1eedi file qua email ho\u1eb7c link t\u1ea3i (Google Drive, Dropbox) ngay sau khi \u0111\u01a1n ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GwIDdz9KfozTBVxeLh5l8OTQg5c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/strong>: H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 gi\u1ea3i \u0111\u00e1p th\u1eafc m\u1eafc, x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3 nhanh ch\u00f3ng \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef uy t\u00edn shop.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vs91d7c2hoBbWTxnHjulll8lg0f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GLwDd6s2coe4EcxlTMmlJPV8ghf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ufo0dSXaXoexA1xX0VQlg4ghgfe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WgKcdLD7goOLBkx2uDgl1cnGgue\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I8pbdtPoaobMrZxLmdAlQWvTg2e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fhnfdkt8zoMDyNxeeLSl5KRNg0e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jv